; The frames for the voice box, a frame behind. Per frame in: snd, V and A (INP at frm, gv, ga) and P (INP at gp);
; the frame's Ks come from kcarry (INP at gk). Out, the frame before it as the voice box reads it: V, P, A,
; K10..K1. A silent frame (snd 0, or 9 for the very last) is unvoiced when a sounding voiced frame comes right after
; it, else voiced; an unvoiced frame's P is 0. After the very last frame (voiced, as nothing follows) comes -1,
; and a stop.
;
; Address Contents Label Opcode Operand Comment
  03            frm     INP   snd      03-09: a frame; the first is only held
  04            gv      INP   v
  05            ga      INP   a
  06            gp      INP   p
  07                    CLA   have
  08                    SUB   00
  09                    TAC   hold
  10                    CLA   ps       10-31: the frame before: its V, if it is silent, then out
  11                    SUB   00
  12                    TAC   psil
  13                    SUB   00
  14                    TAC   pout
  15            psil    CLA   00
  16                    STO   pv
  17                    CLA   snd
  18                    SUB   00
  19                    TAC   pout
  20                    SUB   00
  21                    TAC   chk
  22                    JMP   pout
  23            chk     CLA   v
  24                    SUB   00
  25                    TAC   pout
  26                    CLA   z
  27                    STO   pv
  28            pout    JMP   emit
  29                    JMP   keep
  30            hold    CLA   00
  31                    STO   have
  32            keep    CLA   snd      32-47: this frame is held; after the very last, it goes out too
  33                    STO   ps
  34                    CLA   v
  35                    STO   pv
  36                    CLA   p
  37                    STO   pp
  38                    CLA   a
  39                    STO   pa
  40                    CLA   snd
  41                    SUB   c9
  42                    TAC   frm
  43                    CLA   00
  44                    STO   pv
  45                    JMP   emit
  46                    OUT   m1
  47                    HRS   00
  48            emit    CLA   99       48-67: a frame out: V, P (0 when unvoiced), A, the ten Ks
  49                    STO   ret
  50                    OUT   pv
  51                    CLA   pv
  52                    SUB   00
  53                    TAC   p0
  54                    OUT   pp
  55                    JMP   pa1
  56            p0      OUT   z
  57            pa1     OUT   pa
  58                    CLA   n9
  59                    STO   i
  60            gk      INP   k
  61                    OUT   k
  62                    CLA   i
  63                    SUB   00
  64                    STO   i
  65                    TAC   ret
  66                    JMP   gk
  67            ret     DATA  0
  70            snd     DATA  0
  71            v       DATA  0
  72            a       DATA  0
  73            p       DATA  0
  74            have    DATA  0
  75            ps      DATA  0
  76            pv      DATA  0
  77            pp      DATA  0
  78            pa      DATA  0
  79            k       DATA  0
  80            i       DATA  0
  81            z       DATA  0
  82            n9      DATA  9
  83            c9      DATA  9
  84            m1      DATA  -1
